# Look-first

0. No chat context? → `AGENT_BOOTSTRAP.md` + `STATUS.md` (Skill `cold-start`).
1. Read `PRECODE_MAP.md` (`00/`–`12/`), then legacy `docs/DOMAIN_MAP.md` if needed.
2. Requirements → `03-requirements/` (+ legacy `docs/requirements/` until promoted).
3. Constraints / OQs → `04-constraints/`.
4. Architecture → `07-system-design/` (+ legacy `docs/adr/`).
5. Languages → `07-system-design/options/` (not tip scaffolds).
6. RAG catalog → `research/INDEX.md` (one pack).
7. Prefer primary memos over chat memory; keep claim tiers honest.
